  "pieces": [
    {
      "__v": 9,
      "_id": "59a38829d9eba100763a0f50",
      "background": "",
      "content": "<lightimg bg=\"#e3e2e2\" src=\"https://s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/codex-content/uploads/images/tree-codex-169.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></lightimg><attr style=\"position: relative; top:-3rem; opacity: 0.5;\">A sample of the wallpaper in lift <em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">b</em></attr>\n\n<div class=\"indents\">\n    <p>\n    Get in the lift<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!</em> It will take you where you need<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!</em> Take a look<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!</em> There are 13 lifts to choose from<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!</em> They are <aa to=\"104\">labeled ‘a’ to ‘m’</aa> and are based in different countries<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!</em> Their pits are deep, and their overhead is tall<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!</em> The pit of ‘b’ connects to the overhead of ‘a’, and so on<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!</em> Inside the ‘e’ car is like a rectory and so is quite comfortable<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!</em> It’s really something to behold<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!</em> Hello<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!!</em> Some of the lifts still need configuring<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!!!</em> Don’t use those ones yet<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!!!!</em> But if you zoom in on one of the lifts it splits into a consortium of lifts, so you’ll find one that works for you<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!!!!!</em> And don’t worry<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!!!!!!</em> I guarantee you’ll never meet anyone in a lift<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!!!!!!!</em> The routing and transferring of persons by means of addressed lift cars so that a lift is occupied during the transmission of the person only and upon completion of the transmission the lift is made available for the transfer of other persons<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</em> You should really see for yourself the way that the <aa to=\"127\">wysteria</aa> climbs the mirror in ‘e’<em style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px; margin-left:2px\">!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</em>\n</p>\n</div>",
